                    <li>don't collect any personal information at all,</li>
                    <li>don't use cookies on this website,</li>
                    <li>don't use external services analytics or tracking tools,</li>
                    <li>never store your ip address anywhere.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    Building on these principles, we
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>aggregate browser information like <span class="serif">origin countries</span>, <span
